fn cdrepo i ulong to void
b = new uchar 4096 0
k = getarg i b
fd = walkopen part b 0 k or int 540672 32768 0
if lt fd 0
die2 mcd part b 0 k
end
r = fchdir int fd
x = fclose int fd
